  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I want to iterate right away that having new users who have friends can still join on them but I feel a good way to have new users more likely to have new experience with those who are just starting near their rank and not be overwhelmed by lobbies full of trolls, or kids immediatelly running into sexual avatars and able to find those in their friend group, and not immediatelly lag right away. Yes I know that technically the home world is where we mainly want new users to go to but it can help new users settle in without immediatelly getting an negative experience. Yes there is still going to be a problem with trolls but if these lobbies are a bit stricter with optimization as a start for users (such as only using the vrchat given avatars) I feel it may help people actually ease into the game better for about the first 3 days to a week of play, especially with those just starting just like them.",
